# RocketRide — AI assistant instructions

The contributor guide is `AGENTS.md` at the repository root; it is the single
source of truth and the only file to edit when a rule or command changes.

Contributing to this repo:      read `AGENTS.md`.
Building pipelines with the SDK: read `docs/agents/ROCKETRIDE_QUICKSTART.md`
                                 (product docs — not needed for contributing).
